*8 [[Croco]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 60~80 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 68.33 seconds<sup>2,050f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Yakuza Vampire (Enemy)|Yakuza Vampire]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

